gle layer of enhanced 21700 cells for greater battery efficiency", "CUTTING-EDGE BATTERY DESIGN: Includes copper end plates, power rails and a flexible circuit board for reduced resistance and increased efficiency", "BOSCH-EXCLUSIVE COOLPACK 2.0 TECHNOLOGY: Cools the battery and helps provide longer battery lifetime compared to non-coolpack bosch 18v batteries"]}, "B0B1N7LJD3": {"rating": 4.1, "reviews": 37680, "bullets": ["Outdoor 4 is our fourth-generation wireless smart security camera with up to two-year battery life for around-the-clock peace of mind.", "See and speak from the Blink app — Experience 1080p HD live view, infrared night vision, and crisp two-way audio.", "Two-year battery life — Set up in minutes and get up to two years of power with the included AA Energizer lithium batteries and a Blink Sync Module (sold separately).", "Enhanced motion detection — Be alerted to motion faster from your smartphone with dual-zone, enhanced motion detection.", "Person detection — Get alerts when a person is detected with embedded computer vision (CV) as part of an optional Blink Subscription Plan (sold separately)."]}, "B0F95XVBFS": {"rating": 4.3, "reviews": 62, "bullets": ["Blink Outdoor 2K+ and Blink Battery Doorbell 2K+ deliver sharp 2K video, enhanced audio, and Night Vision that captures color in low light — all powered by months of battery life with no installation ", "Battery-powered protection, now in 2K — Blink Outdoor 2K+ is our next-generation wireless smart security camera that delivers an improved visual and audio experience with sharp 2K video resolution and", "2K video clarity — See more of what matters with sharper 2K video resolution. From subtle textures to defined edges, every frame reveals rich detail and enhanced color even in challenging light condit", "Night Vision - See true color, even in low light, and automatically switch to crisp black and white in near darkness.", "Smart detection —With an optional Blink Subscription Plan (sold separately), receive smart notifications for person and vehicle detection, ensuring you're only notified about the motion that matters m"]}, "B0G625WMBN": {"rating": 4.1, "reviews": 1118, "bullets": ["2K video, battery-powered convenience — Get the precision of 2K resolution with the flexibility of battery power, perfect for renters and homeowners alike. It’s designed for any home and installs in j", "See who's there in 2K clarity — With Head-to-Toe 2K View, capture it all from friendly faces up top to deliveries down low. From subtle textures to defined edges, every frame reveals rich detail and e", "Talk like you're there — Enjoy clear, natural conversations with visitors at your doorstep through two-way audio with noise cancellation.", "Power that goes the distance — Experience months of battery power and protection on just three AA Energizer lithium batteries, giving you reliable security without frequent maintenance.", "Easy to install — Set up your doorbell in minutes and get battery flexibility, making it the perfect wireless security solution for any home."]}}, "clips": {"B09BKMNYQG": [], "B0D5J37XTN": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/7a152b21-8f4f-4b3e-97b5-5b83abef4bb7/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/94aba8c6-f1ec-4226-8c68-03cdf0c3dcf3/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/989af363-c166-4445-ad40-1702ad85ff30/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8"], "B084Q7RBMK": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/a5763f06-fcdf-4863-82e5-09ddc207f9b4/default.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/71516f1f-2421-4439-9943-757fb2e46405/default.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/b6236c0a-1